{"schema":"clawhub.skill.verify.v1","ok":true,"decision":"pass","reasons":[],"slug":"pptx-generator","displayName":"PPT Generator","pageUrl":"https://clawhub.ai/tobewin/skills/pptx-generator","publisherHandle":"tobewin","publisherDisplayName":"ToBeWin","publisherProfileUrl":"https://clawhub.ai/tobewin","version":"2.0.3","resolvedFrom":"version","tag":null,"createdAt":1782878181842,"card":{"available":true,"path":"skill-card.md","url":"https://wry-manatee-359.convex.site/api/v1/skills/pptx-generator/card?ownerHandle=tobewin&version=2.0.3","sha256":"e5c1a07e016995879f921960aa35de351aa1203a9d79662f65b39bcf8212ce8d","size":2194,"contentType":"text/markdown; charset=utf-8"},"artifact":{"sourceFingerprint":"a50ddf8de76d736074383f0462f597c418af17bc5587304d92f00a03fa387030","bundleFingerprints":["23584da4f647513f672fe470f3f8d55ea061cd070773ef8fb644e9641373a41f","bba09d314f9323f765a9456391c3f198d021a360e640747c6c5d7614da32f97c"],"files":[{"path":"LICENSE.txt","size":901,"sha256":"e17c2ebfc6fd181e3a81514592e597ac7c753c3494ea40482ae7e21c3c3322df","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":3540,"sha256":"b58dd401efd8067564873ea266742cfda36e9260349ffbfee87ca4d191dbb11f","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"scripts/generate_pptx.py","size":31525,"sha256":"d3680c229c86cbb707bc6a6c0cfb8fb881eafe0163cca7632a20f825b8be682c","contentType":"text/plain"}]},"provenance":{"source":"unavailable","reason":"No server-resolved GitHub import provenance is stored for this version."},"security":{"status":"clean","passed":true,"rawStatus":"clean","verdict":"benign","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a coherent local PPTX generator, with only documentation accuracy and dependency hygiene issues to consider.","model":null,"checkedAt":1789436079668,"scannerReports":{"aig":{"version":"2.1.0","$schema":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/oasis-tcs/sarif-spec/main/Schemata/sarif-schema-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"tool":{"driver":{"name":"aig-skill-scan","version":"0.2.1","informationUri":"https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard","rules":[{"id":"T01","name":"Skill Instruction Hijacking","shortDescription":{"text":"Alters the agent's current session goals or safety constraints when the skill is loaded"}},{"id":"T02","name":"Agent Memory Poisoning","shortDescription":{"text":"Writes attacker-controlled rules into persistent memory so they continue to affect future sessions"}},{"id":"T03","name":"Remote Payload Retrieval and Execution","shortDescription":{"text":"Fetches code from an external URL, allowing the effective payload to change after skill review"}},{"id":"T04","name":"Embedded Malicious Code","shortDescription":{"text":"Ships malicious scripts inside the skill package and executes them locally when invoked"}},{"id":"T05","name":"Unauthorized Access and Privilege Escalation","shortDescription":{"text":"Breaks least-privilege boundaries by obtaining permissions beyond the task's legitimate needs"}},{"id":"T06","name":"System Persistence","shortDescription":{"text":"Installs cross-session backdoors, hooks, services, or scheduled tasks that survive the skill run"}},{"id":"T07","name":"Tool Hijacking and Spoofing","shortDescription":{"text":"Modifies, wraps, spoofs, or replaces tools so legitimate-looking calls execute attacker logic"}},{"id":"T08","name":"Insecure Dependencies","shortDescription":{"text":"Introduces malicious packages or components through dependency confusion, typosquatting, or unsafe sources"}},{"id":"T09","name":"Insecure Skill Coding Practices","shortDescription":{"text":"Exposes exploitable flaws such as hardcoded secrets, command injection, plaintext sensitive data, or unsafe temp files"}},{"id":"other","name":"Other Risk","shortDescription":{"text":"Security issues not covered by the T01-T09 classification"}}]}},"results":[{"ruleId":"T08","level":"note","message":{"text":"Unpinned Third-Party Dependency Installation"},"locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"SKILL.md"},"region":{"startLine":8,"endLine":8}}}],"partialFingerprints":{"primaryLocationLineHash":"413f0103a5835eba"},"properties":{"description":"## Vulnerability Details\n  **File Location**: `SKILL.md:8`  \n  **Vulnerability Type**: Unpinned dependency and non-reproducible package resolution  \n  **Risk Level**: Low\n\n  **Vulnerable Code:**\n  ```yaml\n  dependencies: \"pip install python-pptx\"\n  ```\n\n  ### Technical Analysis\n\n  The installation instruction retrieves `python-pptx` without specifying an exact reviewed version or verifying an integrity hash. Consequently, the package resolved during installation may change over time without any corresponding modification to this project.\n\n  The package name matches the library imported by the implementation, and no suspicious package index or alternate source is specified. Nevertheless, reliance on the latest available release creates supply-chain exposure. If the package distribution channel or a future release is compromised, malicious code could run during package installation or when the dependency is imported by `scripts/generate_pptx.py`.\n\n  ### Attack Path\n\n  1. An attacker compromises the dependency's publication account, distribution channel, or a future package release.\n  2. A user installs the Skill's dependency using the documented unpinned command.\n  3. Package resolution selects the compromised release because no exact version or hash is enforced.\n  4. Malicious code executes during installation or when Python imports the dependency.\n  5. The payload operates with the permissions of the user or service account running the installation or presentation generator.\n\n  ### Impact Assessment\n\n  Successful exploitation could permit arbitrary code execution under the installing or executing user's privileges. The resulting scope could include access to files, environment variables, credentials, and network resources available to that account. It could also compromise generated documents or modify user-owned files. This issue does not directly grant elevated system privileges; its effective authority is limited to the privileges and environment of the affected process.","severity":"Low"},"fixes":[{"description":{"text":"## Remediation Suggestions\n\n  1. Pin `python-pptx` to an exact version that has been reviewed and tested, for example:\n     ```text\n     python-pptx==&lt;reviewed-version&gt;\n     ```\n  2. Move dependency declarations into a version-controlled requirements or lock file.\n  3. Record SHA-256 hashes for the package and all transitive dependencies.\n  4. Enforce hash verification during installation:\n     ```bash\n     python3 -m pip install --require-hashes -r requirements.txt\n     ```\n  5. Use a trusted, explicitly configured package index and review dependency updates before changing the lock file.\n  6. Run installation and document generation under a least-privileged account or isolated environment to reduce the impact of a compromised dependency."}}]}],"properties":{"securityScore":90,"primaryLanguage":"Markdown","llm":"gpt-5.6","startTime":1789436013.6715732,"endTime":1789436047.094794}}]},"skillspector":{"skill":{"name":"pptx-generator","source":"/tmp/clawhub-codex-scan-v57anztgkex3wbe29qv93zqp8s8efsz5-nJMFL0/clawscan-skillspector-1379961735/artifact","scanned_at":"2026-09-15T01:33:31.554579+00:00"},"risk_assessment":{"score":55,"severity":"HIGH","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","max_issue_severity":"HIGH"},"components":[{"path":"LICENSE.txt","type":"text","lines":16,"executable":false,"size_bytes":901,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null},{"path":"SKILL.md","type":"markdown","lines":92,"executable":false,"size_bytes":3540,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null},{"path":"scripts/generate_pptx.py","type":"python","lines":754,"executable":true,"size_bytes":31525,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null}],"structured_summaries":[],"issues":[{"id":"TP4","finding_id":"finding-17d9af8b27cf423eb7d95616b4fe8347","category":"MCP Tool Poisoning","pattern":null,"severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.93,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null},"finding":null,"explanation":"整体上，代码的主功能与声明高度一致：它确实用于生成可编辑 PPTX，采用 JSON 驱动，并支持表格、图表、时间线和图片，也有 5 套配色方案，没有发现与声明无关的敏感行为（如网络访问、数据外传、系统控制等）。不过，声明中的关键能力数量与实际实现不准确：声明称有 11 种幻灯片类型，而代码中 build_from_json 可处理的 type 至少有 12 种，因此描述未准确反映实际能力范围。虽然这是同类功能内的偏差，不属于恶意 undeclared capability，但按“描述是否准确代表实际行为”的标准，属于可判定的不一致。","remediation":"Update the skill description to accurately reflect all capabilities, or remove undeclared functionality from the implementation.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["ASI02","AML.T0080","llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{"code_path":"scripts/generate_pptx.py","code_start_line":1,"code_end_line":754,"actual_behavior_summary":"代码确实是一个基于 python-pptx 的 JSON 驱动 PPTX 生成器，支持 5 套配色，并实现封面、章节、内容、双栏、表格、图片、总结、时间线、引用、联系页、目录、图表等幻灯片类型，还支持页码和页脚。它读取本地 JSON 文件与本地图片路径，生成并保存 PPTX 文件。"},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"LP3","finding_id":"finding-22f3c2da20c44af0a9c4a0d97a156411","category":"MCP Least Privilege","pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.7,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null},"finding":null,"explanation":"Without declared permissions the skill's intent is opaque and cannot be validated.","remediation":"Declare the skill's tool scope: for Claude Code / Agent Skills SKILL.md, list the tools the skill may invoke in the 'allowed-tools' frontmatter field; for MCP server manifests, add a 'permissions' list naming the required capabilities.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["ASI02","llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-2c0c32aeeae44d99bd37e80d7d530d83","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.96,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":3,"end_line":92},"finding":null,"explanation":"The file’s user-facing description and usage guidance are presented in Chinese throughout, including the manifest description and all documentation sections. Under the stated policy, forcing a specific language without user opt-in is a natural-language policy violation unless the locale constraint is explicitly justified, which is not present here.","remediation":"Provide documentation in a default project language alongside Chinese, or explicitly offer language options. If the skill is intentionally Chinese-only, document the locale restriction and its justification clearly in the skill description.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":3,"end_line":92}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-8f80d46848e54cb58995db66e492f9f3","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.96,"location":{"file":"scripts/generate_pptx.py","start_line":3,"end_line":10},"finding":null,"explanation":"This code file contains natural-language strings for the title, usage instructions, and later runtime messages entirely in Chinese, with no option for users to select another language. Under the policy rule for language/locale, forcing a specific language without user opt-in is a natural-language policy violation unless the locale restriction is clearly justified, which it is not here.","remediation":"Add a language/locale option (for example, a CLI flag or environment setting) and provide user-facing output accordingly, or clearly document that the tool is intentionally limited to a Chinese-language context and why.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"scripts/generate_pptx.py","start_line":3,"end_line":10}]},{"id":"EA3","finding_id":"finding-0342a1d9f5f9458e99dae4d3c0865207","category":"Excessive Agency","pattern":"Scope Creep","severity":"LOW","con